<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia says 1996 inflation rate at 3.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia says 1996 inflation rate at 3.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's inflation rate, as measured by the Consumer Price Index, increased by 3.5 percent year-on-year last year against 3.4 percent in 1995, the Statistics Department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In December 1996, the inflation rate was 3.3 percent year-on-year, the same as in November, the department said.</p>
<p>    CPI		     ---------1996---------   -----1995-----</p>
<p>				Full yr    Dec     Nov     Full yr  Dec</p>
<p>    Change yr/yr pct     3.5	3.3     3.3	3.4	3.2</p>
<p>    Index (base 1994)  107.0    108.4   108.2    103.4    104.9</p>
</text>
